# Third-party desktop tool state that happens to live in this repo root.
# It is a live SQLite database (+ WAL) rewritten on every run, so tracking it
# churned the diff on every commit and bloated history for no benefit.
.freebuff/

# Agent runtime state (not project config — .claude/ itself stays committable
# so per-project agent/skill definitions can be shared).
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/*.lock

# Diagnostics sink — LOCAL ONLY.
# The captured data is redacted, but redaction can only catch shapes it knows
# about, and git history is permanent. An ignored file that leaks is a delete;
# a committed one is a history rewrite plus a credential rotation. Claude can
# still read these by path — nothing is lost by keeping them out of git.
diagnostics/**
!diagnostics/README.md
!diagnostics/.gitkeep
